

<HTML>
<HEAD>
<META NAME="GENERATOR" Content="Microsoft FrontPage 4.0">
<title>Permanemus - Guild Application</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="default.css">
</head>

<body topmargin="0" leftmargin="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" bgcolor="#000000" text="#FFFFFF" link="#FFFFFF" vlink="#FFFFFF" alink="#808080">


<h5>Application</H5>
<font face="Verdana"><b><i>
All LEVEL/CLASS/RACE combinations are welcome in Permanemus</i></b></font>
<p><font face="Verdana">All the questions you are being asked to answer here are with reference to
your main character only.</font></p>
<p><font face="Verdana">This application will be held online for a short
period of time and e-mailed to Gusto Drackonsbane (guild officer) for review, please be honest
you'll get more out of it if you are;</font></p>
<form method="POST" action="app.asp" id=form1 name=form1>
  <table border="0" width="100%" cellpadding="2">
    <tr>
      <td width="20%"><font face="Verdana">Name:</font></td>
      <td><input type="text" name="name" value="" size="43"></td>
      <td><font face="Verdana">How long have you played?</font></td>
      <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana"><input type="text" name="playtime" value="" size="16">
        (Approx.)</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="20%"><font face="Verdana">Class:</font></td>
      <td><input type="text" name="class" value="" size="35"></td>
      <td><font face="Verdana">Level:</font></td>
      <td><input type="text" name="level" value="" size="7"></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>&nbsp;</td>
      <td colspan="3"><input type="checkbox" name="OnlyUser" value="ON"><font face="Verdana">I am the only user of the account?</font></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana">What do you expect of
        Permanemus?</font></td>
      <td colspan="3" valign="top"><textarea rows="2" name="expectperm" cols="47"></textarea></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana">What are your goals in
        Everquest?</font></td>
      <td colspan="3" valign="top"><textarea rows="2" name="eqgoals" cols="47"></textarea></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <table border="0" width="100%" cellpadding="2">
    <tr>
      <td width="20%" valign="top"><font face="Verdana">Have you been in other
        guilds?</font></td>
      <td width="5%" valign="top"><select size="1" name="PreviousGuilds">

          <option value="YES">Yes</option>
          <option selected value="NO">No</option>

        </select></td>
      <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana">If the answer to the
        previous question was Yes, which ones?</font></td>
      <td valign="top"><textarea rows="2" name="whatguilds" cols="42"></textarea></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td width="20%" valign="top"><font face="Verdana">Have you ever grouped or
        had any type of association with a member of Permanemus?</font></td>
      <td width="5%"valign="top"><select size="1" name="groupperm">

          <option selected value="YES">Yes</option>
          <option value="NO">No</option>

        </select></td>
      <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana">If the answer to the
        previous question was Yes, who was it?</font></td>
      <td valign="top"><textarea rows="3" name="whoinperm" cols="42"></textarea></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td valign="top">
        <font face="Verdana">Please enter your e-mail address so we can get back
        to you if we cannot do it in game</font></td>
      <td colspan="3"><input type="text" name="emailaddress" value="" size="49"></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <p align="center"><font face="Verdana" color="#FF0000"><b><i><input type="checkbox" name="acceptcharter" value="ON">
  <font size="2">I
        have read, understood and accepted the guild charter both as a character and as a
        player.</font></i></b></font></p>
  <div align="center">
    <center>
    <table border="0" width="10%" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="4">
      <tr>
        <td width="50%" bgcolor="#35679A"><input type="submit" value="Send request" name="varButtons"></td>
        <td width="50%" bgcolor="#35679A"><input type="reset" value="Reset" name="varButtons"></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    </center>
  </div>
</form>


</BODY>
<script language="VBScript">
	window.form1.name.focus
</script>
</HTML>
